  "id": "EUVD-2026-119420",
  "enisaUuid": "336ff6be-1e46-35ac-aa97-e6347081ee8d",
  "description": "Tornado before 6.6 does not validate the max_age argument of RequestHandler.set_cookie (also called by set_signed_cookie, set_secure_cookie, and clear_cookie), allowing injection of additional Set-Cookie attributes. When an application passes attacker-influenced input as max_age, an attacker can embed attributes such as Domain, Path, or Secure to widen the cookie's scope to parent paths or other subdomains.",
